  m_Name: Carta_HabitacaoModularVerde
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Habita\xE7\xE3o Modular Verde"
  _titleEn: Green Modular Housing
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Casas e pr\xE9dios montados com m\xF3dulos feitos em f\xE1brica ficam
    prontos mais r\xE1pido e desperdi\xE7am menos material que a obra tradicional."
  _summaryEn: Homes and buildings assembled from factory-made modules are finished
    faster and waste less material than traditional construction.
  _realWorld: "A constru\xE7\xE3o pr\xE9-fabricada \xE9 usada h\xE1 d\xE9cadas em
    v\xE1rios pa\xEDses, e estudos de ciclo de vida comparam o seu impacto ambiental
    com o da obra no local."
  _realWorldEn: Prefabricated construction has been used for decades in many countries,
    and life-cycle studies compare its environmental impact with on-site building.
  _tradeOffs: "Transportar os m\xF3dulos \xE9 dif\xEDcil, as op\xE7\xF5es de projeto
    s\xE3o mais padronizadas e \xE9 preciso ter f\xE1bricas por perto."
  _tradeOffsEn: Transporting modules is hard, design options are more standardized
    and factories need to be nearby.
  _sources:
  - Label: Prefabricated building (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prefabricated_building
